pps."},{id:"item-2",name:"Amit Chhillar",role:"customer",rating:5,location:"Sohna Sector 4, Haryana",avatar:"🧑🏻‍💻",comment:"The user experience is amazing. I can easily order authentic local local food (like fresh paranthas, sweet kulhad lassis, and hot paneer tikkas) from local spots that weren’t available on national networks. Highly recommended in Sohna!"},{id:"item-3",name:"Sardar Gurpreet Singh",role:"restaurant",rating:5,location:"Owner of Sohna Biryani Darbar",avatar:"👳🏻",comment:"Our daily order volumes have increased by more than 40% since onboarding with ECD KART. Their business dashboard is super easy to manage on mobile. The daily driver dispatch is extremely professional and prompt."},{id:"item-4",name:"Meenakshi Sharma",role:"restaurant",rating:5,location:"Founder, Shahi Thali House, Sohna",avatar:"👩🏻‍🍳",comment:"I run a women-operated cloud kitchen near Sohna Bus Terminal. ECD KART gave us the digital visibility we needed to scale. Their low commission rates have helped us stay highly profitable while reaching thousands of new homes!"},{id:"item-5",name:"Rajesh Kumar",role:"delivery",rating:5,location:"Independent Rider, Sohna Hub",avatar:"🧑🏻‍✈️",comment:"I work with ECD KART part-time in the evenings. The weekly direct bank deposits are 100% reliable every Tuesday. The active support team solves map route bottlenecks quickly, and customers in Sohna are clean and generous with tips!"},{id:"item-6",name:"Vikram Gurjar",role:"delivery",rating:5,location:"Lead Delivery Partner, Sohna",avatar:"🧑🏻‍🚀",comment:"The extra fuel incentives for further customer hotspots make a big difference. I can easily plan my flexible shifts. The free medical insurance coverage gives my family great peace of mind. Very proud to ride under this teal flag!"}],r=s==="all"?c:c.filter(d=>d.role===s);return n.jsx("section",{className:"py-20 bg-accent-charcoal-light/10",id:"testimonials",children:n.jsxs("div",{className:"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8",children:[n.jsxs("div