{className:"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600"}),title:"Our Commitment to Sohna",description:"Unlike massive national conglomerates, 100% of our tax deposits, support center wages, and delivery fees remain in the Sohna municipality to grow local careers."}];return n.jsxs("div",{className:"bg-accent-charcoal-light/30 min-h-screen py-12",children:[n.jsxs("div",{className:"bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-teal to-accent-teal-dark text-white py-16 text-center relative overflow-hidden",children:[n.jsx("div",{className:"absolute inset-0 bg-radial from-accent-gold/10 to-transparent opacity-60 pointer-events-none"}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10",children:[n.jsx("span",{className:"text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-accent-gold uppercase bg-accent-gold/20 text-accent-gold-light border border-accent-gold/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full",children:"Our Legacy"}),n.jsx("h1",{className:"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold mt-4 tracking-tight",children:"Who We Are & What We Stand For"}),n.jsx("p",{className:"mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-semibold",children:"ECD KART is Sohna's native online food-tech platform, built to bridge the gap between hungry food lovers and incredible kitchen creators."})]})]}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-20",children:[n.jsxs("div",{className:"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center",children:[n.jsxs("div",{className:"lg:col-span-7 space-y-6",children:[n.jsx("span",{className:"text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-accent-teal uppercase bg-accent-teal-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full",children:"Founding Story"}),n.jsxs("h2",{className:"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-accent-charcoal",children:["Why We Started ",n.jsx("span",{className:"text-accent-teal",children:"ECD KART"})]}),n.jsx("p",{className:"text-sm sm:text-base text-accent-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed font-medium",children:"Sohna (Haryana) is growing at an incredible speed. With universities like G.D. Goenka and K.R. Mangalam welcoming thousands of students, alongside busy working professionals settling in Sector 2, 4, and Gurgaon-Sohna Express corridors, the demand for fast, clean, and delicious meals was higher than ever."}),n.jsxs("p",{className:"text-sm sm:text-base text-accent-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed font-medium",children:["Yet, local sweet vendors, cloud kitchens, and beloved point-of-sale stalls in Sohna Chowk were completely ignored by massive national agregates due to structural boundaries. Customers had to pay high prices, while hard-working chefs lost huge commissions. We launched ",n.jsx("strong",{children:"ECD KART"})," to put control back where it belongs—in the hands of local chefs and family kitchens."]}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-accent-gold shadow-xs",children:[n.jsx("p",{className:"text-xs text-accent-charcoal/70 italic font-bold",children:'"Our technology represents more than just a quick delivery link. It stands for localized job generation, fair commissions, and delicious culinary traditions delivered directly with care."'}),n.jsx("span",{className:"text-[10px] uppercase font-black text-accent-teal mt-2 block tracking-wider",children:"— ECD KART Operations Team"})]})]}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"lg:col-span-5 bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-xl space-y-6",children:[n.jsx("h3",{className:"font-display font-extrabold text-xl text-accent-charcoal pb-3 border-b border-gray-100",children:"Our Track Record In Sohna"}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-4",children:[n.jsxs("div",{className:"pb-4 border-b border-gray-50 flex justify-between items-center",children:[n.jsx("span",{className:"text-sm text-accent-charcoal/70 font-semibold",children:"Local Foodies Fed Daily"}),n.jsx("span",{className:"font-mono text-lg font-black text-accent-teal",children:"2,500+"})]}),n.jsxs("div",{className:"pb-4 border-b border-gray-50 flex j